&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh manages approximately €1.7B in annual direct procurement spend across ingredients and packaging, covering markets in the EU, US, Canada, ANZ, and the UK. This role builds the cost intelligence capability for Global Procurement. You will create the analytical models and frameworks that give the business clear visibility into what ingredients really cost: where those costs come from, how they move, and where the opportunities lie. Your work will give regional teams the insight they need to make well-grounded decisions and to track progress against the group&#39;s cost reduction ambitions. This is a role for a senior procurement professional who is comfortable with detailed analysis and who can explain complex numbers simply to senior leaders and to colleagues in markets. You will be recognised as the go-to expert on cost across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a harmonised cost measurement methodology with Finance and regional procurement teams, so that ingredient savings are defined, measured, and reported consistently across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build should-cost models and total cost of ownership frameworks for priority categories, breaking unit price into its drivers (origin, processing method, logistics, certification, and shelf life), and use them to identify savings and inform sourcing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track ingredient price drivers across markets, including contract prices, actual prices, and market inflation, and identify overlap across brands to find rationalisation and consolidation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report progress against the group&#39;s ingredient cost reduction target to senior leadership, explaining root causes rather than just variances, and help build the governance needed to sustain this over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are....&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical professional who builds models that hold up to scrutiny from Finance and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded: you look at total value, not just unit price, and you understand what drives cost in food and packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who turns complex analysis into a simple story that regional teams can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: you build alignment with Finance, procurement, and market teams through influence rather than authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed: you manage several analyses at once and take ownership from the question through to the recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have....&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in procurement, cost analysis, or consulting in a global food, retail, or consumer goods business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building should-cost models or total cost of ownership frameworks, and using them to influence real commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring cost and savings across multiple markets, including the common pitfalls such as inconsistent methods, inflation effects, and volume mix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with food, ingredient, or packaging categories, including origin, certification, and specification considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English. Bonus if fluent in French, German, or Dutch. Comfortable working across time zones, with the ability to travel up to 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sustainability certification schemes and their cost implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commodity price risk or hedging frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh we embrace and welcome diversity and we currently employ over 15,000 individuals globally who contribute to this. We employ individuals based on their ability to perform a job rather than on the basis of their: race, national origin, color, caste, social origin or position, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, political opinion, marital status or any other characteristic. We encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunity employer – everyone is welcome at our table.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Director Tax, you will lead the Group Tax Department, overseeing all group-wide tax matters and a team of four professionals. This is a strategic yet hands-on role where you will develop group-wide tax optimization opportunities, lead tax audits, and continuously evolve the group tax and transfer pricing strategy. You will be part of the Group Finance Leadership Team, working closely with the CFO and company leadership to ensure tax compliance and support special projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the team:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead and manage the Group Tax Department, which includes direct responsibility for a team of four skilled professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage tax matters:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be responsible for all group-wide tax matters, collaborating with local and international group companies on various aspects of (corporate) tax law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; You will continuously develop the group tax and transfer pricing strategy for the Group and identify group-wide tax optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; You will oversee the group’s tax compliance activities, including preparing corporate income tax and VAT returns for German group companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee financial reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be responsible for deferred tax positions (IFRS and HGB) in annual, consolidated, and quarterly financial statements, as well as financial planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle audits:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead tax audits and appeal proceedings, and be responsible for selecting and coordinating external consultants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have 10+ years of professional experience in a similar leadership role within an international company&#39;s tax department or a leading international tax consultancy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven track record of leading and motivating high-performing teams. You are a people leader who can also &quot;go deep&quot; on complex tax matters with a hands-on attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a degree in economics, business, or law with a focus on taxation and ideally have successfully completed the German tax advisor exam (&lt;em&gt;Steuerberaterprüfung&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tax Law:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess strong knowledge of both German and international tax law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You work analytically, are structured and goal-oriented, and are comfortable using data and advanced analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You have excellent German and English language skills and enjoy working in a dynamic international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your career with excitement! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access, wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options. HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Position: Was steckt in der Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Senior Industriemechatroniker&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(all genders)&lt;/strong&gt; übernimmst Du die Verantwortung für die Reparatur und Wartung unserer fördertechnischen Anlagen. Du arbeitest in einem dynamischen, innovativen Umfeld, das kontinuierlich an der Optimierung seiner Systeme arbeitet. Mit Deinem Fachwissen und Deinen kreativen Ideen trägst Du entscheidend zur Weiterentwicklung bei und findest gemeinsam im Team die besten Lösungen für das Unternehmen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In dieser Schlüsselposition wirst Du maßgeblich dazu beitragen, die Verfügbarkeit und Effizienz unserer technischen Anlagen zu maximieren und unsere Prozesse kontinuierlich zu verbessern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hast Du Lust, an unserem modernen Standort in Barleben bei Magdeburg zu arbeiten und dabei Deine Expertise einzubringen?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Werde Teil der Tagschicht mit Arbeitszeiten von Montag bis Freitag!&lt;/strong&gt; Dann bewirb Dich bei uns!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Aufgabenbereich: Das Rezept&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist zuständig für die Ausführung der präventiven (PM), prädiktiven (PdM) und korrektiven (CM) Instandhaltung unserer automatisierten und pneumatischen Anlagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst die Wartung und Fehlerbehebung an Fördertechnik, pneumatischen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anlagen, Robotersystemen und Hochregalsystemen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt bei Root Cause Analyses (RCAs), um Ursachen auf den Grund zu gehen und nachhaltige „100-Jahre-Lösungen“ zu entwickeln, statt nur kurzfristige Flicken zu setzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Im Falle von kritischen Ereignissen oder Systemnotfällen unterstützt du das reaktive Team vor Ort bei der Entstörung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten und hilfst bei der Optimierung unserer Prozesse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest den Ausbau und die Modernisierung bestehender Anlagen im gesamten Cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
