&lt;div id=&quot;processing-state-26-summary&quot; class=&quot;processing-state_details ng-trigger ng-trigger-menuExpansion ng-tns-c879422873-771 is-gpi-avatar ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers.The kind of people who not only pioneered a more flexible approach to commerce architecture but also shaped the culture of experimentation that approach unlocked. Together, they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here, the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Hello!&lt;/span&gt; I&#39;m Roberto Olmeda, leading the Search Discovery Team at commercetools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Search is fundamentally changing shape. Shoppers are moving from keywords to full sentences—and increasingly, the client querying our APIs isn’t a human at all, it’s an AI agent. My team builds the core retrieval layer behind product discovery for the world’s most demanding commerce brands. As we take semantic and hybrid search to general availability, we’re tackling hard engineering problems at every layer: from query understanding and vector indexing down to latency, measurable relevance, and the cost of a single query. &lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Search Engineer to build across Elasticsearch, Kubernetes, and our functional Scala backend—whether you already love functional programming or are excited to master it with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement search functionalities in a PaaS ecommerce Scala backend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop search capabilities that combine lexical, semantic, and hybrid retrieval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop search-related libraries based on ElasticSearch and MongoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to search relevance and quality, and to how we measure it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and maintain a scalable search “infrastructure as code” on top of Kubernetes using terraform and multi-tenant architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test software components regarding usability, functionality, and performance, and work closely with Product Management and DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn Scala and functional programming as your new main development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in on-call rotation with a worldwide distributed team for production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is hybrid, with three days a week spent in our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Munich, Berlin, London or Valencia&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work. You do not need to be an ML researcher for this role. You need to be a strong backend engineer who is genuinely interested in retrieval quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience as a Software Engineer, with production experience on the JVM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of parallel and asynchronous programming, as well as non-blocking I/O&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing REST APIs and knowledge of scalable architectures, including sharding, replication, load balancing, and failover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working with Scala using pragmatic functional programming patterns. If you come from another JVM language, we will support you in picking it up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English for work in international teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating multi-tenant SaaS where one tenant’s load must never affect another’s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of scalable event-driven architectures, including queues and notification topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on search experience, preferably ElasticSearch or OpenSearch, including a working understanding of how an inverted index scores and ranks documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical exposure to vector retrieval, such as embeddings, approximate nearest neighbor indexes, and hybrid ranking, and a sense of where each approach breaks down. A deep lexical search background plus a clear appetite to go into this territory also works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort reasoning about relevance with data, including precision and recall tradeoffs, ranking metrics, and behavioral signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure work and other technologies like Helm, Kubernetes, and Rust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
