&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;first-token&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Hello!&lt;/span&gt; I&#39;m &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/emil-pfrang-b8b00a65/&quot;&gt;Emil Pfrang&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Director Information Security&lt;/strong&gt; at commercetools. Trust is the foundation of modern cloud commerce. My team operates right at the intersection of global privacy law, cloud architecture, and AI innovation—ensuring our multi-tenant SaaS platform remains compliant, resilient, and trusted by the world’s most ambitious enterprises. Rather than treating compliance as a static checkbox exercise, we partner closely with product, engineering, and external clients to navigate evolving global regulations and safely bring new AI capabilities to market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Data Protection and Compliance Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a critical role in maintaining and elevating commercetools’ global data privacy and compliance framework. Operating at the intersection of legal requirements, cloud technology, and software engineering, you will advise internal teams, work closely with external clients, and ensure our multi-tenant SaaS platform adheres to international data privacy laws (such as GDPR, and relevant global privacy regulations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data protection and privacy advice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert (SME) on global data protection laws (GDPR, CCPA, HIPAA where applicable, UK GDPR, etc.) for internal product, engineering, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise departments on privacy and data protection topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with department heads and process owners to collect all required information about each processing activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check and assess vendors and assets for data protection and privacy as part of the supplier assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and handle the privacy related requests from employees, customers, and authorities, e.g. requests for information, requests for deletion, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review Data Transfer Impact Assessments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check and assess AI tools and features from a privacy perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review customer Data Processing Agreements (DPAs)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support assessments of AI tools and AI features from a privacy perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audits, strategic compliance and maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor global legal developments, court rulings, and regulatory guidance to update commercetools’ internal policies continuously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance of process documentation within data protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage data protection training together with our external DPO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and maintain key privacy documentation, including Data Processing Agreements (DPAs), Privacy Policies, and Privacy Notices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the Record of Processing Activities (RoPA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audits from privacy and data protection perspective&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data protection evidence for internal and external audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute internal compliance audits: Support departments on identifying compliance needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance policy management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance of whistleblower platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork. Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in law, business informatics or a related field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in data protection or privacy compliance, ideally at a SaaS or tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of the GDPR (Art. 13–21, 28, 30, 35, 44 ff.). Knowledge of the EU AI Act, CCPA or HIPAA is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with privacy management tools, ideally OneTrust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of ISMS frameworks (ISO 27001, SOC 2)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, detail-oriented way of working with a strong focus on documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications such as CIPP/E, CIPM, CIPT (IAPP), or CISA are a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,13,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
