&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3726 - Associate Director, Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics, Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT WPP &amp;amp; OPENDOOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP, we’re constantly reinventing the future of creativity on an ever-broader canvas, bringing together unrivalled talent, resources and skills to provide an integrated offer of communications, experience, commerce and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last decade, we have developed a dedicated global client practice with the mission of accelerating WPP’s impact for our largest clients by bringing them the best of WPP. Each team is custom-built around a client’s specific needs and challenges, providing easy access to the right capabilities. And that’s why we’ve built &lt;strong&gt;OpenDoor &lt;/strong&gt;for&lt;strong&gt; Amazon&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenDoor&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique integration of the best of WPP and Amazon – building on their respective strengths and visions. Whether at WPP or at Amazon, every project is an OpenDoor on new possibilities. Anything and everything can be an opportunity for our people to drive &lt;em&gt;impact&lt;/em&gt; – for them to innovate, learn, thrive, and occasionally fail too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The unique OpenDoor partnership model is built to deliver next level Productivity, fueled by our industry-leading approach to People, Platforms, and Process. OpenDoor spans across all WPP agencies and disciplines such as media, business consultancy, communications and brand strategy, tech and commerce, public relations, and production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenDoor’s values are built from Amazon’s own &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.amazon.jobs/content/en/our-workplace/leadership-principles&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;16 Leadership Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and WPP’s core values of Open, Optimistic and Extraordinary. Together, when WPP’s Creative Transformation meets Amazon’s next-level customer centricity, our people come together to challenge and impact what’s done today and build a better future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining OpenDoor, not only are you joining a cross-function team partnering with one of WPP’s top five global clients, but you are also taking a step to challenge yourself and the world around you every day, working in the most unusual way on some of Earth’s most ambitious opportunities in marketing, tech, media, business, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are searching for a talented and enthusiastic individual to join our OpenDoor team as a Data Governance Director. This is a full-time, senior leadership position. This role plays a crucial part in supporting WPP&#39;s mission to deliver consistency, delivery excellence and best-in-class service for Amazon in every country across its MGM and CDS business lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role will act as the key operational bridge across internal WPP teams, client leadership, local market contacts, offshore delivery teams, external creative agencies, and third-party partners. By establishing robust workflows, owning platform integrations, and managing data governance compliance, you will ensure campaigns are executed accurately, on time, and in strict alignment with global standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Excellence Associate Director, you will be a strategic leader, focused on taxonomy compliance and responsible for championing a customer-centric data excellence strategy, fostering strong relationships with senior stakeholders, and significantly investing in the growth and development of the Data Governance team. You will drive adoption of data quality standards, ensuring OpenDoor&#39;s data assets provide maximum business impact for Amazon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Activation and Client Leadership to ensure the day-to-day operations of the line of business run seamlessly. Collaborate with relevant eternal stakeholders (e.g. DoubleVerify) to ensure accurate account configuration and tracking integrity, while coordinating team training sessions for newly released features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and brief teams on essential operational infrastructure, including live/pre-live status documents, proof of posting (PoP) trackers, Wrike workflows, workback schedules, and other tracking templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GOC Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure clear delegation and structured briefings to remotely based Global Operations Centre ad ops teams delivery teams to guarantee flawless campaign tracking and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Trafficking &amp;amp; Stakeholder Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trafficking Execution Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with activation and GOC delivery teams to ensure campaigns are accurately trafficked, tags are correctly implemented, and delivery issues are resolved rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Local Market Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an operational bridge between DoubleVerify and local market teams during onboarding to align platform setups with upcoming advertising activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Activation, Client Leadership, and platform teams on daily operational workflows and feature training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxonomy, Governance &amp;amp; PBR Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PBR Score Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full accountability for meeting and exceeding the target 97.5%+ Taxonomy PBR (Performance-Based Reward) compliance score for this line of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Control (QA):&lt;/strong&gt; Process oversight (including QA) of trafficking sheets, delivery documents, and briefing templates prior to offloading to offshore execution teams to guarantee taxonomy compliance at setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Schedule, design, and facilitate regular &quot;Taxonomy &amp;amp; Workflow&quot; refresher sessions throughout the year to keep the team aligned on platforms, processes, and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issue Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Act swiftly to address taxonomy discrepancies, collaborating directly with relevant teams to ensure urgent amendments are understood and executed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry &amp;amp; Tech Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay ahead of product developments from Choreograph (specifically around Campaign Governance) and monitor updates to the PBR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Governance &amp;amp; Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in the implementation of data pipelines, quality policies and best practices, designing and building frameworks rather than just executing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and approve data standards, policies, business rules, and tools, ensuring they align with overarching WPP and Amazon strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy the metadata management framework to cover data lineage, access control, and data catalogue requirements across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption in data quality methodologies and tooling for the region, simplifying complex data governance frameworks into actionable strategies that can be broadly adopted and understood.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize resource allocation for regional data excellence initiatives, demonstrating creativity and resourcefulness to achieve maximum impact with efficient use of budget and headcount.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Management &amp;amp; Production Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and manage the highly detailed RMI campaign spec sheet (production plan), ensuring the template remains fit for purpose for both internal WPP teams and external client/agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Liaison:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead regular calls with external creative agencies, ensuring all technical, creative, and operational queries are resolved in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous attention to detail to ensure the RMI spec sheet is populated correctly and accounts for all nuanced creative agency requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Create post-campaign narratives and lead &quot;Wash Up&quot; (post-mortem) sessions for complex campaigns (such as Enhanced Engagement initiatives) to optimize future creative management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to define and execute a regional data excellence strategy, aligning with broader organizational goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership and Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience in leading, guiding, evaluating, and developing junior team members and potentially managers for both current success and future growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional presentation, communication, and negotiation skills, capable of simplifying complex technical concepts for executive audiences and managing cross-team and client dialogues at the highest level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in building and deploying data governance frameworks, including metadata management, data lineage, and access control.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Full-Funnel Media Capability:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of technical full-funnel media capabilities, coupled with advanced data and analytics literacy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build strong relationships and influence senior leaders and client stakeholders across diverse markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in driving organizational change related to data quality and data literacy across large, complex organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A reputation as a responsible, accountable leader with the willingness to dive deep into complex data issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in a senior operations role within a media, creative, or digital agency network (experience within WPP is a strong plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Ad Ops Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience creating CM360 accounts, linking DV360 profiles, and integrating DoubleVerify setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International media management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
