&lt;p&gt;Start: immediately | Level: Intermediate | Location: Switzerland, remote | Working hours: Full-time (40h/week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More Nutrition already has a very large presence in Switzerland with an 8-digit revenue, double digit growth and significant investment. Our presence has been anchored into the German-speaking part of Switzerland; we’re set to expand while growing our presence in Romandy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Marketing Manager, you will report into the VP, International, and will be responsible for developing and executing our brand strategy for More Nutrition in Switzerland, with a particular focus on Romandy. You will also start seeding the French market. Speaking French is MANDATORY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will create impactful campaigns, drive local marketing initiatives and ensure a consistent brand experience across all touchpoints. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, agencies and local stakeholders to significantly expand our presence in the Swiss market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve got a good understanding of cultural nuances between German-speaking Swizterland, Romandy and France. You’ve worked in a fast-paced consumer goods or FMCG environment, operating both with big retailers and direct online sales platforms. You’re comfortable in newly created roles, working with multiple functional stakeholders, and can roll up your sleeves to execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· As brand guardian, you develop and implement the brand strategy for Switzerland, combining global guidelines with local consumer insights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You define the marketing activation calendar and lead the planning and execution of omnichannel campaigns (incl. mass media, influencer marketing, TikTok and point of sale)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You brief and manage agencies to create on-brand, locally relevant assets (in German and French) and ensure timely campaign delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You track brand metrics (awareness, equity, engagement) and campaign KPIs and use this data for continuous optimisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You work closely with cross-functional teams to guarantee a consistent brand experience across D2C, pure play and point of sale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You coordinate closely with the local commercial teams to align marketing activities with market and sales targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You help shape the local product portfolio based on the needs and potential of the Swiss market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience &amp;amp; skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· French speaking is mandatory Ideally you have experience working both in French-speaking Swizterland and France. You have some level of understanding of how the shopper may differ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have 4–6 years of solid professional experience as a brand or marketing manager in FMCG / consumer goods, ideally in food &amp;amp; beverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have proven experience leading or managing one or more brands in Switzerland or France with revenues of at least CHF 30 million&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have solid experience managing a D2C business and omnichannel campaigns (incl. mass media, influencer marketing, social media such as TikTok and Meta, as well as point of sale + pure play)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You stand out with a strong hands-on mentality, excellent project management skills and a genuine enthusiasm for cross-functional collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have a data-driven mindset and are confident using digital marketing tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You are fluent in French and are confident using English for our internal communication. Speaking German is of course a definite plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At The Quality Group, more than 1,200 people share a common mission: to rethink nutrition – healthier, smarter and with real added value for the community. We believe in team spirit, ownership and the courage to push boundaries. Every contribution counts, regardless of location or department. Depending on where you join us, you can look forward to various benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Attractive employee discounts on ESN &amp;amp; More products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Flexible working hours &amp;amp; home office options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Workation options and more&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the application process, you&#39;ll find out which specific benefits await you at your location and what it means to be part of TQG: a company shaping the future of nutrition with passion, quality and courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Quality Group (TQG) is an innovative provider of sports nutrition products and has united the successful brands ESN and More Nutrition since 2021. ESN has been Germany&#39;s market leader in sports nutrition since 2004, offering products such as protein powders, bars and supplements designed for ambitious fitness goals. More Nutrition, founded in 2017, stands for healthy, sugar-reduced nutrition products and offers solutions for mindful eating and weight management – without sacrifice. TQG&#39;s vision is to help people become the best version of themselves. With passion and innovative strength, the company develops high-quality products that promote health, performance and joy of life. With an agile corporate culture and exciting career opportunities, TQG is a strong partner not only for customers but also for employees. That&#39;s us – The Quality Group – nice to meet you! Now it&#39;s your turn! We look forward to receiving your application! Regardless of gender, age, background or identity – what matters to us is who you are and what you bring. Join our team and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Suisse de préférence, France à discuter, télétravail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Début : dès que possible | Niveau : Intermédiaire | Lieu : Suisse, télétravail | Temps de travail : temps plein (40 h/semaine)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More Nutrition bénéficie déjà d’une très forte présence en Suisse, avec un chiffre d’affaires à 8 chiffres, une croissance à deux chiffres et des investissements importants. Notre présence s’est jusqu’ici ancrée en Suisse alémanique ; nous souhaitons à présent poursuivre notre expansion en renforçant notre présence en Romandie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Marketing Manager, tu seras rattaché(e) au VP International et seras responsable du développement et de la mise en œuvre de notre stratégie de marque pour More Nutrition en Suisse, avec un focus particulier sur la Romandie. Tu commenceras également à nous positionner sur le marché français.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce rôle, tu exécuteras nos campagnes de marque, piloteras les initiatives marketing locales et garantiras une expérience de marque cohérente. Tu travailleras en étroite collaboration avec les équipes commerciales, DTC, marketing, produits…, les agences et autres partenaires locaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu as une bonne compréhension des nuances culturelles entre la Suisse alémanique, la Romandie et la France. Tu as de l’expérience en biens de consommation ou FMCG dans des environnements dynamiques et as travaillé à la fois avec de grandes enseignes et des plateformes D2C. Tu es à l’aise dans des postes nouvellement créés, tu sais collaborer avec différentes fonctions et tu es orienté(e) action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merci de nous envoyer ton dossier de candidature en anglais.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ta mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;· En tant que gardien(ne) de la marque, tu développes et mets en œuvre la stratégie de marque pour la Suisse, en associant guidelines globales et insights consommateurs locaux&lt;br&gt;· Tu définis le calendrier d’activation et pilotes la planification et l’exécution de campagnes omnicanales (médias de masse, marketing d’influence, TikTok et point de vente inclus)&lt;br&gt;· Tu briefes et pilotes les agences pour créer des contenus conformes à la marque et adaptés localement (en allemand et en français)&lt;br&gt;· Tu suis les indicateurs de marque (notoriété, capital de marque, engagement) ainsi que les KPI de campagne et tu les optimises continuellement&lt;br&gt;· Tu travailles en étroite collaboration avec des équipes transverses pour garantir une expérience de marque cohérente sur tous les canaux&lt;br&gt;· Tu adaptes l’assortiment local en fonction des besoins et du potentiel du marché suisse (et français)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton expérience &amp;amp; tes compétences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;La maîtrise du français est obligatoire. Idéalement, tu as de l’expérience à la fois en Suisse romande et en France. Tu comprends les différences de comportement entre consommateurs suisses et français.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as 4 à 6 ans d’expérience professionnelle en tant que Brand Manager ou Marketing Manager en FMCG / biens de consommation, idéalement en Food &amp;amp; Beverage.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as géré une ou plusieurs marques en Suisse ou en France générant un chiffre d’affaires d’au moins 30 millions CHF.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as une solide expérience dans la gestion d’un business D2C et de campagnes omnicanales (médias de masse, marketing d’influence, réseaux sociaux comme TikTok et Meta, ainsi que point de vente + pure players).&lt;br&gt;· Tu te distingues par un fort esprit opérationnel, d’excellentes compétences en gestion de projet et un fort esprit de collaboration.&lt;br&gt;· Tu es analytique et maîtrises les outils de marketing digital.&lt;br&gt;· Tu parles couramment français et utilises l’anglais avec aisance au quotidien dans un contexte professionnel. Parler allemand est un atout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Pourquoi nous ?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez The Quality Group, plus de 1 200 personnes partagent une mission commune : repenser la nutrition – plus saine, plus intelligente et avec une réelle valeur ajoutée pour la communauté. Nous croyons en l’esprit d’équipe, à la responsabilité individuelle et au courage de repousser les limites. Chaque contribution compte, quel que soit le site ou le service. Selon l’endroit où tu nous rejoins, différents avantages t’attendent, notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Des réductions attractives pour les collaborateurs sur les produits ESN &amp;amp; More&lt;br&gt;· Des horaires flexibles &amp;amp; des possibilités de télétravail&lt;br&gt;· Des options de workation et plus encore&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cours du processus de recrutement, tu découvriras les avantages concrets proposés sur ton site et ce que signifie faire partie de TQG : une entreprise qui façonne l’avenir de la nutrition avec passion, qualité et courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;À propos de nous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Quality Group (TQG) est un fournisseur innovant de produits de nutrition sportive qui réunit depuis 2021 les marques à succès ESN et More Nutrition. ESN est depuis 2004 le leader du marché allemand de la nutrition sportive et propose des produits tels que des protéines en poudre, des barres et des compléments alimentaires adaptés aux objectifs de fitness ambitieux. More Nutrition, fondée en 2017, est synonyme de produits nutritionnels sains et à teneur réduite en sucre, et propose des solutions pour une alimentation consciente et la gestion du poids – sans privation. La vision de TQG est d’aider chacun à devenir la meilleure version de lui-même. Avec passion et esprit d’innovation, l’entreprise développe des produits de haute qualité qui favorisent la santé, la performance et la joie de vivre. Grâce à une culture d’entreprise agile et à des opportunités de carrière passionnantes, TQG est un partenaire solide non seulement pour ses clients, mais aussi pour ses collaborateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;C’est nous – The Quality Group – ravis de te rencontrer ! À toi de jouer ! Nous nous réjouissons de recevoir ta candidature ! Quel que soit ton genre, ton âge, ton origine ou ton identité – ce qui compte pour nous, c’est qui tu es et ce que tu apportes. Rejoins notre équipe et grandis avec nous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At IMC, technology is not a department; it’s at the heart of everything we do. Developed in-house, our innovative software makes millions of trading decisions daily, and we win by making better and faster decisions than our competition. Our on-site IT Support team helps us move at a higher pace and quality each day, from hands-on support for end users to configuring and automating our systems to scale our support capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this fully on-site position, you are the first person people come to with any IT issue, whether it’s a MacBook, a SaaS application, identity and access management, or hardware and AV. You support our growing Zug office and act as first- to third-line support. Our environment is predominantly macOS and cloud-based, with a small Windows footprint. You’ll work across a wide range of SaaS and custom systems. To succeed and grow, you take ownership, work autonomously, and keep improving an IT environment that runs smoothly and is ready to scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-to-third line support for our users, mainly on macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and supporting our end-user platform, including Microsoft 365, Okta (SSO, MFA, lifecycle management), Slack and the Atlassian stack (Jira, Confluence, Jira Service Management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Device management and patching: Jamf for macOS and Intune for phones, including enrollment, configuration profiles, app deployment and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarding and offboarding, including account provisioning, access management and device setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Installing, setting up and servicing hardware and peripherals, including laptops, monitors, printers, and audio and video conferencing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting, escalating and documenting network and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automating repetitive tasks and keeping knowledge base articles and runbooks in Confluence up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizing and performing desk moves, room setups and physical equipment moves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Everything else that keeps us moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in an ICT-related field (BSc level ideally), or an equivalent qualification such as Informatiker/in EFZ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one year of experience in a similar role in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong macOS knowledge and hands-on experience with JAMF (Pro).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft 365 administration and Intune; working knowledge of Windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Okta or a similar identity provider (SSO, SCIM, MFA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering or supporting Slack and the Atlassian suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting experience (Bash, Zsh, Python or PowerShell) is a plus, and so is Linux experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting and diagnostic skills, with the ability to solve problems creatively and proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take on physical tasks such as desk moves and room setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong drive to grow (at IMC we are committed to helping with that).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work autonomously, with a sense of urgency, and prioritize based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available and willing to work on-site full-time in Zug.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in written and spoken English; German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our high-performing Swiss sales team. We help leading enterprise organizations in Switzerland optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will build and grow relationships to drive sales cycles from discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a portfolio of enterprise accounts headquartered in Switzerland, combining existing customers, where you will expand our footprint, with new / greenfield accounts, where you will win new logos for Celonis. Navigating complex organizations from operational leaders up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts&#39; needs and drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Manage a balanced portfolio of existing customers (land-and-expand) and new / greenfield accounts (new logo acquisition)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build pipeline in greenfield accounts through targeted prospecting and account planning&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage stakeholders across lines of business, from operational leaders up to C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence sales motions across the core enterprise value chain, translating business challenges into compelling, AI-enabled use cases that deliver measurable execution capacity&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Hold an individual revenue target for closing six-figure+ deals within your accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage closely with partners e.g., consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners...&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grow your skills through structured enablement, coaching and close collaboration with experienced Strategic Account Executives and your Sales Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3+ years of relevant experience in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;br&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;SaaS Sales: Track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex B2B software solutions to enterprise accounts, ideally with experience in both expanding existing customers and winning new logos.&lt;br&gt;○ &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AI / Management Consulting: Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, delivering AI or digital transformation projects with exposure to account management, client relationships, and business development.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A track record of meeting or exceeding targets, commitment, and successful career progression with your previous companies&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A hunter mentality: proven ability to prospect, open doors and build pipeline in new accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong business acumen and a solid understanding of core processes and KPIs across the enterprise value chain (e.g., Finance, Procurement, Supply Chain)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Curiosity and the ability to quickly understand different industries and business models&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to build trusted relationships with Business and IT stakeholders and the confidence to engage up to the C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grit, a hands-on mindset, strong discovery skills and a structured approach to running sales processes&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent communication and presentation skills in German (fluent) and English&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Eagerness to learn and develop, open to feedback and coaching&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich area location preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; candidates based elsewhere in Switzerland must be available for &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;weekly in-person presence&lt;/strong&gt; and customer visits (primarily in &lt;strong&gt;German-speaking Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
